# Obscure everything by default (code, scripts, models, datasets, checkpoints, logs, internal drafts)
*

# Allow directories to be scanned so paper/ can be whitelisted
!*/

# Whitelist ONLY public empirical paper (Markdown & compiled PDF), paper README, cited literature, root README, LICENSE, and .gitignore
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!paper/
!paper/README.md
!paper/paper_FSTLLM_30M_TinyStories_Empirical_Evaluation.md
!paper/paper_FSTLLM_30M_TinyStories_Empirical_Evaluation.pdf
!paper/letteratura_confronto/
!paper/letteratura_confronto/**

# Explicitly ignore private folder and all internal drafts inside paper/privato/
paper/privato/
paper/privato/**
